	)
	(text "Diodes are TPESD0402G05V bidirectional ultra-low capacitance (0.05 pF) \nESD protection diode. No polarity - either pin may be tied to GND.\nProtects logic from ESD & cable transients.\nEncoder is the E6B2-CWZ6C NPN Open-collector Output Model."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 186.436 93.726 0)
